WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.760
- [Kelly] But your CODA
co-star Daniel Durant

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.110
competed in Dancing With the Stars.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.520
So, that was last season.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.980
Did you ever get a chance to go watch him?

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.120
- [Interpreter] I absolutely did.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.010
I was there, me and Troy Kotsur,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.550
we were like the proud
onscreen parents for Daniel,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.160
visiting our son on
Dancing With the Stars.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:22.160
And we rooted him on and
he is such a great dancer.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.330
He's in a different place here, you know,

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.700
watching him dance as opposed to acting.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.930
Totally outside of the box.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:28.980
We were so proud of him.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:29.813
We were so proud of him.

00:00:29.813 --> 00:00:30.660
- Do you like dancing?

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:31.743
I love dancing.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.370
- [Interpreter] I like dancing, but

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.440
I don't know about being in
front of 25 million people

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.850
and then having them
vote for me about that.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:39.990
I don't know if I like that.
(audience laughing)

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:40.823
- No, no, no.

00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:42.060
I just meant dancing in general.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:42.893
I think it feels so good.
- [Marlee] Yeah, yeah.

00:00:42.893 --> 00:00:44.100
Yeah, yes.
- Yeah.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.560
- I love to dance anytime,
anywhere, anybody.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.210
- Oh, it felt so- you don't,

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.738
she didn't even have a bar, anybody.

00:00:50.738 --> 00:00:55.373
That's amazing.
(Kelly and Marlee laughing)

